shortdesc A lightweight and robust key-value parser
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides lightweight and robust facilities for
longdesc creating and managing keys. Its machinery isn't as extensive as
longdesc that of, e.g., the ltxkeys package, but it is equally robust;
longdesc ease of use and speed of processing are the design aims of the
longdesc package.
